      "problem": "What fraction is missing from the statement below?\n\n$$\n16\\times \\frac{5}{8}=\\frac{\\bbox[2pt,border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{A}}}{\\bbox[2pt,border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{A}}}\\times 5\n$$",
